# PART 2: Power BI Setup

## Step 2.1: Open Power BI Desktop

If not already open, click Start → type "Power BI Desktop" → open it.

Go to **File** → **Open**.

Look for your file (if you already have a PBIX) or click **Create Blank Report**.

