```
Macro Analysis Steps:
1. Extract with olevba (oletools):
   $ olevba suspicious.docm

2. Look for:
   ├─ AutoOpen / Document_Open (auto-execute triggers)
   ├─ Shell / WScript.Shell (command execution)
