│  □ Search for Event 104 (System log cleared)                         │
│  □ Check for gaps in event log timeline                              │
│  □ Check for wevtutil or Clear-EventLog commands                     │
│                                                                       │
│  SECURITY TOOL TAMPERING                                              │
