│  □ Check PowerShell 4104 logs for encoded commands                   │
│  □ Look for string concatenation evasion ("po" + "wer" + "shell")   │
│  □ Check for AMSI bypass patterns in script logs                     │
│  □ Monitor for base64 decode operations (certutil -decode)           │
│                                                                       │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

